# E104: wrk OpenHarmony 平台适配
id: E104-draft-wrk
software: wrk
version: 4.2.0
category: platform_compat
severity: medium

error_pattern: |
  struct sigaction: incomplete type
  uname -s returns "HarmonyOS" not matched in Makefile

diagnosis: |
  wrk Makefile uses TARGET detection based on uname -s, but HarmonyOS returns "HarmonyOS" not "linux"
  musl libc requires explicit POSIX definitions for struct sigaction

solution: |
  1. Add HarmonyOS target in Makefile:
     ```makefile
     else ifeq ($(TARGET), harmonyos)
         CFLAGS  += -D_POSIX_C_SOURCE=200112L -D_BSD_SOURCE -D_DEFAULT_SOURCE
         LIBS    += -ldl
         LDFLAGS += -Wl,-E
     ```
  2. Add signal.h header in src/wrk.h

dependencies: []
